findings.body:
Any authenticated user can now read any account by posting `{"accountId":"<other-id>"}`. The `auth(req)` call only establishes the caller identity; nothing verifies the caller is staff or otherwise permitted to access a different account.

```suggestion
const caller = await auth(req);
if (body.accountId && body.accountId !== caller.accountId) {
  // require staff role / allow-list here
  return new Response("forbidden", { status: 403 });
}
const id = body.accountId ?? caller.accountId;
```
